--- !u!114 &1029600274
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1029600272}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 66c9fa903b2f31c428731d8baacf4882, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  IndonesianText: 'Hari ini aku mengunjungi nenekku di Jalan Melati No. 3, nomor
    rumahnya berwarna merah seperti apel matang. Saat aku tiba, jam sudah menunjukkan
    pukul 1 siang (jam nenekku berwarna kuning cerah), dan aroma kue bolu yang baru
    keluar dari oven tercium begitu harum.


    Di teras, aku melihat 2 ekor kucing
    sedang tidur di garasi, di bawah 4 pot bunga berwarna merah muda terdapat selembar
    kertas yang tergulung dengan tulisan aneh:


    "Rahasia tersembunyi di balik
    3-4-1-2 : merah, merah muda, kuning, hitam."'
  EnglishText: 'Today i visited my grandmother at Jalan Melati No. 3 her house number
    is red like a ripe apple. when i arrived. it was already 1 p.m.(my grnadmother''s
    clock was bright yellow), and the aroma of sponge cake was fresh out of the oven.


    On
    the porch, I saw 2 cat sleeping in the garage, beneath 4 pink flower pots was
    a rolled-up piece of paper with starnge writing:


    "The secret is hidden
    behind 3-4-1-2 : red, pink, yellow, black."'
  KoreanText: 
  ChineseText: 
  ArabianText: 
  JapaneseText: 
  StartEvents:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  UpdateEvents:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
