  dialogManager: {fileID: 1415868321}
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1272010481}
  dialogLines_ID:
  - permisi nek, aku mau nanya kost ini dimana ya?
  - ???
  - gatau ya nek? ok permisi
  - "jangan pergi kesana\u2026"
  - kenapa ya nek?
  - " jangan\u2026"
  - apaansih gajelas bgt ni nenek suka ngelantur
  dialogLines_EN:
  - Excuse me, ma'am. I wanted to ask, do you know where this boarding house is?
  - ???
  - "You don\u2019t know, ma'am? Okay, excuse me then."
  - "Don\u2019t go there\u2026"
  - Why not, ma'am?
  - "Don\u2019t\u2026"
  - What the heck? This old lady is so weird, always rambling.
  speakers_ID:
